      "bridgeId": "be-34",
      "theorem": "PhysJS.KibbleZurek.exponent",
      "covers": "derivation-step: the freeze-out power ε̂ = (τ₀/τ_Q)^(1/(1+zν)) and the defect density without the Boltzmann factor; omitting the 1 in the exponent fails. Not the reheating factor, and not a repair of the missing 1/a^d prefactor",
